   "text": "Deal state machine: DRAFT → MATCHING → NEGOTIATING ↔ NEGOTIATION_AGREED → PI_SENT → PI_ACCEPTED → ESCROW_PENDING → ESCROW_FUNDED → PO_ISSUED →\nSUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY → QC_PASSED | QC_FAILED → IN_TRANSIT → CLEARED → PAID · QC_FAILED → DISPUTE → CANCELLED | REFUNDED | SUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY (re-inspection) · PI_SENT/PI_ACCEPTED/ESCROW_PENDING → CANCELLED (unfunded playbook)",
   "originalText": "Deal state machine: DRAFT → MATCHING → NEGOTIATING ↔ NEGOTIATION_AGREED → PI_SENT → PI_ACCEPTED → ESCROW_PENDING → ESCROW_FUNDED → PO_ISSUED →\nSUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY → QC_PASSED | QC_FAILED → IN_TRANSIT → CLEARED → PAID · QC_FAILED → DISPUTE → CANCELLED | REFUNDED | SUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY (re-inspection) · PI_SENT/PI_ACCEPTED/ESCROW_PENDING → CANCELLED (unfunded playbook)",
