   "updated": 1792818001030,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Still EXT by design: the buyer accepts the PI, funds the escrow and accepts the goods; the supplier quotes and ships; providers inspect, carry and pay out. External actors to generate deliberately (not /actor-pipeline's automatic loop): india-supplier-finder-ai, container-tracking-ai.",
   "originalText": "Still EXT by design: the buyer accepts the PI, funds the escrow and accepts the goods; the supplier quotes and ships; providers inspect, carry and pay out. External actors to generate deliberately (not /actor-pipeline's automatic loop): india-supplier-finder-ai, container-tracking-ai.",
   "fontSize": 10.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "o534vC5ked6tPcdP",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1798,
   "width": 1329,
   "height": 14,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1433040698,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1115820070,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792818001030,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Money never moves on PortLess's word alone: tranches need independent proof, the final tranche needs the buyer (or the lapsed window), payouts are capped at funds received, every money gate is clamped by the ceiling and four-eyes.",
   "originalText": "Money never moves on PortLess's word alone: tranches need independent proof, the final tranche needs the buyer (or the lapsed window), payouts are capped at funds received, every money gate is clamped by the ceiling and four-eyes.",
